hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"577","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab Surah Al-Ma'idah nazil hui to main Adba' (oontni) ki lagaam pakde hue thi, aur woh itni bhari thi ke us ke wazan se mera bazu katne ke qareeb tha."
"578","[AI-translation] Urwah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Surah Yasin ki ayat «فَمِنْهَا رَكُوبُهُمْ وَمِنْهَا يَأْكُلُونَ» [36-Yasin:72] ko Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke mushaf mein is tarah padha: «فَمِنْهَا رَكُوعَبُتُهُمْ وَمِنْهَا يَأْكُلُونَ»."
"579","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne un se poocha: 'Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ki niyyat kya thi?' To unhon (Ibn Abbas) ne kuch zikr kiya, lekin ham ne use yaad nahin rakha. Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ne ghar ki chhat ki taraf dekha, aur unhon ne Ya'qub (Alaihissalam) ko apna hath pakde hue dekha kahte hue: 'Kya tum jahilon ka kaam karna chahte ho jabke tumhara naam nabiyon (Alaihimussalam) mein likha hua hai?' To (yeh sun kar), har qism ki khwahish jo un ke jism mein thi nikal gai, aur woh darwaze ki taraf daude, aur woh bhi un ke peeche daudi aur un ki qameez phaad di."
"580","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ke 'waqiye' ke bare mein poocha gaya, woh kya tha? (Woh kahan tak pahuncha?) Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne apni kamarband khol di thi, phir unhen ek awaz se pukara gaya jo suni nahin gai, to un se kaha gaya: Aey Ya'qub ke bete! Kya tum zina ka irada rakhte ho? Tum us parinde ki manind ho jaoge jo apne par nochta hai phir us ke par baqi nahin rahte."
"581","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se bachchon ke bare mein poocha gaya, kya woh jannat mein honge? Unhon ne kaha: Musa aur Khizr (Alaihima assalam) ne is muamle mein bahas ki, aur woh tumhare liye kafi hai."
"582","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Allah Ta'ala ke qaul: 'Us ke ghar walon mein se ek gawah ne gawahi di' ki tafseer mein kaha, ke woh badshah ka khaas aadmi tha."
"583","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Un ki dadhi thi."
"584","[AI-translation] Abdur Razzaq se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Isra'il (Ibn Yunus bin Abi Ishaq) ne hamen isi sanad se wohi alfaz bataye."
"585","[AI-translation] Mujahid (Rahimahullah) se Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Surah Sad mein sajde ke bare mein riwayat hai: Unhon ne kaha: Woh bande ki tauba hai ya nabi ki tauba hai. To Allah ne Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is mein un ki pairwi ka hukm diya."
"586","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Allah ne un par wajib farmaya tha ke ek dus ke muqable mein lade, to yeh un par bhari aur mushkil hua. Phir Allah ne is (mushkil, bojh) ko un se hata diya aur hukm diya ke ek do ke muqable mein lade aur samna kare, to Allah Ta'ala ne yeh ayat nazil farmai: «إِنْ يَكُنْ مِنْكُمْ عِشْرُونَ صَابِرُونَ يَغْلِبُوا مِائَتَيْنِ» 'Agar tum mein se bees sabr karne wale hon to woh do sau par ghalib aaenge.' Aur phir unhon ne ayaton ke aakhir tak tilawat ki. Phir unhon ne kaha: «لَوْلَا كِتَابٌ مِنَ اللَّهِ سَبَقَ لَمَسَّكُمْ فِيمَا أَخَذْتُمْ عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ» 'Agar Allah ki taraf se pahle tehreer na hoti to jo tum ne liya us mein tumhen azeem azab pahunchta.' Yani Badr ki ghanimat. Allah farmata hai: Mera tareeqa hai ke main us ko azab nahin deta jo meri nafarmani kare yahan tak ke main use pahle khabardar kar dun. Phir Allah ne farmaya: «يَا أَيُّهَا النَّبِيُّ قُلْ لِمَنْ فِي أَيْدِيكُمْ مِنَ الْأَسْرَى إِنْ يَعْلَمِ اللَّهُ فِي قُلُوبِكُمْ خَيْرًا» 'Aey Nabi! Un qaidiyon se kaho jo tumhare hathon mein hain, agar Allah tumhare dilon mein khair janta hai...' Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Yeh ayat mere bare mein nazil hui jab main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne Islam ke bare mein bataya, aur Aap se darkhwast ki ke mujhe un bees ooqiya ke liye na pakden jo Aap ne mujh se liye the. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe bees ghulam diye; woh sab us maal se tijarat karte jo tumhari milkiyat mein tha, aur us ke sath Allah ki taraf se bakhshish zakheera thi."
"587","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jang Badr se farigh hue to Aap se kaha gaya: Aap ko is tijarati qafile ka peecha karna chahiye; is ke siwa kuch nahin hai. To Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhen pukara — jabke woh apne bandhan mein the (unhen rassi se bandha gaya tha) — ke woh tumhare liye jaiz nahin hai. To Aap (Nabi) ne farmaya: Kyun (jaiz nahin)? Unhon (Abbas) ne kaha: Kyunke Allah ne tum se donon girohon mein se ek ka wa'da farmaya tha, aur Us ne tumhare liye woh poora farmaya jo Us ne tum se wa'da farmaya tha."
